From a7b24ee1556c109670c9dabbc4c5cfd98239fb63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thomas Vu <thomas@local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 23:47:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(fe-gba): resolve ATTACK via opportunities/adjacency;
 longer combat settle

Prefer attack_opportunities (move_to==cursor) then adjacent same-named enemy
over first weak name match (Unit 0x3E duplicates caused 3,9 aim after MOVE
to 8,4). Wire opportunities into executor state. Increase post-ATTACK settle
and keep CAP retries / soft reconnect without killing the loop.
